  storyText: "Family\n\nTeo lowers the rifle. \"Family rule: we help people the corps are hunting.\" He takes you to Ines, an old nomad netrunner.\n\nInes: \"There's an old military satellite uplink in the desert, from before the DataKrash. NetWatch forgot it. It could reach the Wall.\"\n\n1. Go to the uplink.\n2. \"Tell me about the old Net.\"\n3. \"Can I just... stay here?\""
